Pako Engineers - Impeller Balancing Standards

Impellers are machined and balanced for stable rotating performance in centrifugal pump assemblies.

Typical scope:
- Open, semi-open, closed, and mixed-flow impellers
- Outside diameter: up to 1500 mm
- Bore fits: custom H7/h6 or drawing-specific
- Dynamic balance: ISO 1940 G6.3 or G2.5
- Machined surface finish: Ra 1.6 to 3.2 microns
- Inspection: DPT, bore check, keyway check, and balancing report

Balancing grade is finalized against operating speed and rotor mass.
